  "details": "<p>The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: Fonte Romito During five excavation campaigns (1979-1985), the remains of a pre-Roman center of habitation were explored at Fonte del Romito. These remains begin in the ninth century B.C. with evidence for huts of the Italian Iron Age. A planned urban center of the first century B.C. was also identified.</p>",
